      "created_at": "2018-02-06T08:38:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As the name suggests its a Chokepoint fight in her favorite environment&nbsp;Omnitron IV.&nbsp;</p><p>You get Expatriete, Sky-Scraper Extremist, Best of Times Chrono Ranger, Extreeeem&nbsp;Argent Adept... I am sensing a theme.&nbsp;</p><p>Got a near mint. I forgot about the&nbsp;don't use the go back button. My plan as it always is with chokepoint was to punch her repeatedly as hard as I can. Tactical Shotgun+Hollow points + Rebel Yell was my friend.&nbsp;</p>",
