      "created_at": "2018-02-06T14:09:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy and fun Mint. Being able to have fun in Omni-IV is a rare thing. Went Huge at the right time to throw environment things at Chokepoint, and she also helped clean out the robots for us. It was the environment that finished her off, in fact!</p>",
