      "id": 214348,
      "name": "Reverend Pete",
      "username": "Reverend_Pete",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-06T15:13:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With so much hero deck reshuffling, this will be different for everybody. That said, it was a fun romp in robot world.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sky-Scraper destroyed environment targets, Chrono-Ranger did a bunch of nothing other than destroy the initial Kinetic Looter with a Temporal Grenade, and Argent Adept kept Yelling at Expatriette to load and then fire her shotgun. Every. Single. Round. I think Expatriette got tired of being Yelled at so much, but boy was it effective.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At the end, Expatriette 13HP, Sky-Scraper 10HP, Chrono-Ranger 14HP, and Argent Adept 14HP.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:45:31.709Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
