      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a3d4f5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-06T15:21:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint because... it's just Chokepoint.<br><br>I was dismayed when I saw this One-Shot because I assumed it would be Challenge or Ultimate Chokepoint and I just cannot wrap my mind around how you're supposed to play around her Challenge ability... but it was just regular Chokepoint, so Skyscraper basically beat her up single-handedly while also keeping the environment empty with her Huge power, with minor assists from the rest of the team.</p>",
