      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-07T01:53:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. Had Expat beat down on Chokepoint with her Tactical Shotgun and Hollow Points for the first half of the match until CR got his bounties and the Masada out. SS and AA played support with SS helping Expat and CR get their stuff out and AA helped the damage dealers do more damage through his Rebel Yell.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Was kind of waiting for the environment to do something awful but it didn't happen. Ending HPs: Expat- 16, SS- 12, AA/CR- 11.&nbsp;</p>",
