    {
      "id": 214351,
      "name": "bolnerap",
      "username": "bolnerap",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-07T02:01:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint, HP 21/18/20/17.</p><p>I, uh, had a much different game than most of you. Chrono-Ranger only saw one equipment card (Temporal Grenade, which I used to blow up Kinetic Looter) and otherwise twiddled his thumbs. Expat lost her Shotgun turn 2 and never saw another one. Clearly I should have played a Micro-Assembler on her, but I spent the whole game making it into the Sky-Scraper show and dropping Links all over the place.</p><p>AA did some stuff too - he got out the Bell and Syncopated Onslaught, which was helpful.</p><p>By the middle of the match, Chokepoint was dealing 3 damage (5 - 1 - 1) to one target and hitting herself for 2 each turn thanks to double Stimulators, and Sky-Scraper kept swapping back and forth based on what I needed (Tiny for extra damage, Huge for environment destruction and extra damage). By the time the Techno Pursuers came out, Chokepoint was the lowest and they helped chew her up.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:45:31.915Z",
