      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-07T19:47:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Micro-Assembler on Chrono-Ranger to pull out the Neurotoxin, and use it twice a round thanks to AA.&nbsp; Had plenty of equipment to sacrifice thanks to Sky-Scraper, who also shut the environment down hard.&nbsp; Expat's job was just to use her Shotgun and load it with the most damaging ammo she could find.&nbsp; Utterly trivial challenge, even though Sky-Scraper was the only one who didn't do basically the same thing round after round.</p>",
