      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Micro-Assembler on Chrono-Ranger to pull out the Neurotoxin, and use it twice a round thanks to AA.&nbsp; Had plenty of equipment to sacrifice thanks to Sky-Scraper, who also shut the environment down hard.&nbsp; Expat&#39;s job was just to use her Shotgun and load it with the most damaging ammo she could find.&nbsp; Utterly trivial challenge, even though Sky-Scraper was the only one who didn&#39;t do basically the same thing round after round.</p>",
